 "last_activity": "2017-03-30T22:17:56Z",
 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "lw88g5SnAQAJ",
   "from": "sergen...@gmail.com",
   "author": "acef63e02be77b2b",
   "date": "2017-03-29T13:22:51Z",
   "subject": "R Shiny server on Ubuntu disconnects with server after upload file more than maximum upload size(5MB",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">I have installed shiny server in Ubuntu 16.04.2 which I use as my computer. I can connect to server and see my application from any computer connected from network when i enter the host-name on address line. The problem is; when try to upload a data file (CSV) that more than 5MB, it accepts the file and upload it. But after 1 or 2 seconds (I guess when it starts the reading function in server.R) it disconnects with server.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">This is the code which allow to upload file more then 5MB. I wrote this code into global.R file.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><pre style=\"padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(16,16,148)\">if</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">Sys.getenv</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&#39;SHINY_PORT&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">!=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n options</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">shiny.maxRequestSize</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">10000</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">*</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">1024</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">^</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">}</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">I have also tried :</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><pre style=\"padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">options</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">shiny.maxRequestSize</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">10000</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">*</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">1024</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">^</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">And here my reading function for data file in server.R</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><pre style=\"padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">  Dataset </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">({</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(16,16,148)\">if</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">is.null</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">data1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(133,140,147)\"># User has not uploaded a file yet</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(16,16,148)\">return</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">data.frame</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">())</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n  inFile </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">data1\r\n  Dataset </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> as.data.frame</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">do.call</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;read.csv&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> args </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> \r\n  list</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">inFile</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">datapath</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n                                          header </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">header</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n                                          sep    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">  input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">sep</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n                                           quote </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">  input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">quote\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">})</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Thank you</p></div>"
    ]
   ]
